# blend::Mode, blend_scope, and the transition counter.
#
# Blend state used to sit outside the wrapper, so reaching it meant naming
# raylib:: directly, which forfeits sokol and hides the state change from the
# library. Hidden, a redundant transition cannot be skipped: puzzle paid
# 2.372ms of BeginBlendMode and 1.452ms of EndBlendMode to issue 0.005ms of
# blits.
#
# The count in the title is deterministic and decomposes: 6 for the swatches
# (Alpha costs nothing, it is already active), 16 for the row that wraps each
# blit, 2 for the row that hoists one scope round all eight. That 16-vs-2 is
# the entire gap.

goto_screen blend_mode_lab
wait 0.6
validate_screen blend_mode_lab
assert_within_parents

resize 1920 1080
wait 0.3
assert_within_parents
resize 1280 720
wait 0.3
